<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Infoseek upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Infoseek upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co reasearch analyst Keith Benjamin raised the rating on Infoseek Corp to long-term attractive from market performer.</p>
<p>- Benjamin cited better-than-expected fourth quarter results, including revenues of $6.1 million and an earnings per share loss of $0.15, versus estimated revenues of $5.7 million and EPS loss of $0.17.</p>
</text>
